Output ../setup.gif
Output ../setup.mp4

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1100
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 4ms

Hide
Type "cd /workspace"
Enter
Show

Type "python3 labs/01-secret-exfiltration/media/show.py setup"
Enter
Sleep 12s
